=== D: ★ sigma(r*/r_d) 之真值 ===
  第九輪 (scripts/36) 用 naive 獨立傳播:
    sigma = sqrt((0.26/144.43)^2 + (0.26/147.09)^2) = 0.25229%
  ★ 但 r_d 同 r* 係**同一個後驗**推導出 => 高度相關 => 獨立傳播高估

  -- D1: 線性參數響應 (CAMB, col-5 中心) --
    d ln(r*/r_d)/d(omega_b_h2) = +0.03402% per 1sigma
    d ln(r*/r_d)/d(omega_c_h2) = +0.00103% per 1sigma
    d ln(r*/r_d)/d(H0) = +0.00000% per 1sigma
    => sigma_prop(r*/r_d) = 0.03403%
    => 比 naive (0.25229%) 細 7.41x

  -- D2: CAMB Monte Carlo (col-5 後驗, 400 樣本) --
    MC-A (只 Omega_b h^2, 400 樣本): mean = 0.98190044  sigma = 0.03222%
    MC-B (Omega_b h^2 + Omega_c h^2, rho = -0.6, 400 樣本): mean = 0.98191688  sigma = 0.03209%

  -- D3: 欄間散佈 (獨立數據組合之交叉核對) --
            全部 6 欄: mean = 0.98241811  std = 0.13844%  (n = 6)
        排除 EE (c3): mean = 0.98186500  std = 0.03180%  (n = 5)
        排除 TT 同 EE: mean = 0.98200145  std = 0.01035%  (n = 4)

  -- D4: 反解 rho(r_d, r*) --
    sigma_naive^2 = sigma_rd^2 + sigma_rs^2 - 2*rho*sigma_rd*sigma_rs
    => rho(r_d, r*) = 0.98398
  [PASS] D1 ★ sigma_prop(r*/r_d) < 0.05% (0.03403%)
  [PASS] D2 ★ MC-A sigma 同線性傳播一致 (差 < 20%) (0.03222% vs 0.03403%)
  [PASS] D3 ★ MC-B (含 Omega_c h^2) sigma 仍然 < 0.05% (0.03209%)
  [PASS] D4 ★★ 欄間散佈 (排除 EE) 0.0318% 同 MC 0.0321% 吻合到 < 1% (0.03180% vs 0.03209%)
  [PASS] D5 ★ rho(r_d, r*) 反解 > 0.95 => 高度相關, 獨立傳播失效 (0.98398)
  [PASS] D6 ★ sigma_naive / sigma_true > 7 (7.86x)

